@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route113/scripts.inc: Route113_Text_FunWalkingThroughAsh
Hoenn_Route113_Text_FunWalkingThroughAsh::
	.string "It's fun walking through the volcano's\n"
	.string "ashes on the ground and grass.\p"
	.string "You can see where you walked--it's\n"
	.string "really neat!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route113/scripts.inc: Route113_Text_AshCanBeFashionedIntoGlass
Hoenn_Route113_Text_AshCanBeFashionedIntoGlass::
	.string "Wahahaha! Today's technology is a\n"
	.string "wondrous thing!\p"
	.string "Take this volcanic ash here.\n"
	.string "It can be fashioned into glass.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_JaylenIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_JaylenIntro::
	.string "Can you guess why it's so cool\n"
	.string "around here?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_JaylenDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_JaylenDefeat::
	.string "Peeuuw!\n"
	.string "That stinks!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_JaylenPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_JaylenPostBattle::
	.string "The volcanic ash blocks the sun,\n"
	.string "so it doesn't get very warm.\p"
	.string "That's good for me--I can't stand heat!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_DillonIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_DillonIntro::
	.string "The volcano's eruption is proof that\n"
	.string "the earth is alive.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_DillonDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_DillonDefeat::
	.string "You're some kind of strong!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_DillonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_DillonPostBattle::
	.string "Ouch! Owww! I can't see!\n"
	.string "I got ashes in my eyelashes!\p"
	.string "Get it? Ashes and eyelashes?\p"
	.string "Okay, that was bad, sorry…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_MadelineIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_MadelineIntro::
	.string "I use this parasol to ward off this\n"
	.string "filthy, yucky volcanic ash from\l"
	.string "my dear NUMEL.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_MadelineDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_MadelineDefeat::
	.string "Huff, huff…\n"
	.string "I am exhausted…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_MadelinePostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_MadelinePostBattle::
	.string "You're very good at this.\n"
	.string "I must say I'm impressed!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LaoIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LaoIntro::
	.string "From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\n"
	.string "I challenge thee!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LaoDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LaoDefeat::
	.string "With honor I admit defeat!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LaoPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LaoPostBattle::
	.string "I must refine the art of concealment.\n"
	.string "I bid thee farewell.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LungIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LungIntro::
	.string "Thanks for finding me!\n"
	.string "But we still have to battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LungDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LungDefeat::
	.string "I'll use my ninjutsu on you…\n"
	.string "“VOLCANIC ASH SWIRL CLOAK”!\p"
	.string "…What?\n"
	.string "It's already over?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LungPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LungPostBattle::
	.string "You know what's crummy about hiding?\n"
	.string "It's lonely if no one comes along.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_ToriIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_ToriIntro::
	.string "TORI: Both of us, we collect ashes.\n"
	.string "We battle POKéMON, too.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_ToriDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_ToriDefeat::
	.string "TORI: We lost… It's boring, so I'm going\n"
	.string "to get some more ashes.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_ToriNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route113_Text_ToriNotEnoughMons::
	.string "TORI: We want to battle 2-on-2.\n"
	.string "If we didn't, we would lose!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_ToriPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_ToriPostBattle::
	.string "TORI: How much ash do we have?\n"
	.string "Enough for a WHITE FLUTE, I hope.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_TiaIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_TiaIntro::
	.string "TIA: Both of us, we collect ashes.\n"
	.string "We battle POKéMON, too.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_TiaDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_TiaDefeat::
	.string "TIA: We couldn't win… It's boring,\n"
	.string "so I'm getting some more ashes.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_TiaNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route113_Text_TiaNotEnoughMons::
	.string "TIA: We want to battle 2-on-2.\n"
	.string "If we don't, we won't win!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_TiaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_TiaPostBattle::
	.string "TIA: We have a lot of ashes!\n"
	.string "I think enough for a WHITE FLUTE!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_WyattIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_WyattIntro::
	.string "Y-you want to battle with me?\n"
	.string "Even though I just caught my POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_WyattDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_WyattDefeat::
	.string "Y-you're all happy to win?\n"
	.string "Even though it's only me?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_WyattPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_WyattPostBattle::
	.string "Oh, so now you want to say a word to\n"
	.string "the loser?\p"
	.string "Aren't you just the coolest?\n"
	.string "Humph!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LawrenceIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LawrenceIntro::
	.string "Were you maybe in the middle\n"
	.string "of gathering volcanic ashes?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LawrenceDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LawrenceDefeat::
	.string "Ehehe.\n"
	.string "We got beaten cleanly.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_LawrencePostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_LawrencePostBattle::
	.string "I ought to hide under the ashes, too.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_SophieIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_SophieIntro::
	.string "The warmth here is making me drowsy.\n"
	.string "Battle with me so I can stay awake.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_SophieDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_SophieDefeat::
	.string "This is a dream.\n"
	.string "I'm sure of it…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_SophiePostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_SophiePostBattle::
	.string "Losing burns me up…\n"
	.string "I'm just going to sleep right here!\l"
	.string "Zzz!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_CobyIntro
Hoenn_Route113_Text_CobyIntro::
	.string "Pfft, with these wings I can\n"
	.string "flick you away!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_CobyDefeat
Hoenn_Route113_Text_CobyDefeat::
	.string "A… What?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route113_Text_CobyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route113_Text_CobyPostBattle::
	.string "I don't know what to say when I get\n"
	.string "beaten so easily…$"

